# maps.db
# Map and area definitions for the MapSystem
#
# MAPS section
#   id | name | scale | map_image | unlock_condition
#   unlock_condition: "none" = always unlocked
#                     a map id = unlocked when that map is fully explored
#
# AREAS section
#   id | map_id | area_index | name | button_x | button_y | frames_file
#   area_index: 0-based order within the map (controls button reveal order)

